  <metadata>
    <name>Fiesta dawn ascent, 8 August 2026</name>
    <desc>Balloon drift from Ashton Court on the measured winds of the Saturday dawn mass ascent. Altitude is the pilot's only control; the track curves where the balloon crosses a wind layer.</desc>
